o dodge.\nYou can also use the special items to throw your opponent off.\nWho will come in 1st place, will it be you?", "short_description": "It\u2019s a 1v1 sport that you can win by tossing the balls at the opponent, or by sending more balls than the opponent after the time runs out.\nThe sport looks so simple, just tossing around the rock ball, yet if you get a chance to participate, you will realize that it involves a lot of strategy.\nTry competing with other players by playing online!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.vrotein.co.kr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.vrotein.co.kr/", "publisher_name": "VRotein", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.vrotein.co.kr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2102474253245742"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1270017409785903", "version": "1.01"}, "id": "279445129155811", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1224996980954613", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "12700174097859